# cargo-fuzz build output, crash artifacts, and libFuzzer's *working* corpus.
#
# The curated seeds live in `seeds/<target>/` and ARE committed, so a clean checkout
# always starts from the same inputs (see `README.md`). `corpus/<target>/` is where
# libFuzzer accumulates the thousands of mutated inputs a run discovers — run output,
# not source, and not reproducible across runs.
/target
/artifacts
/corpus
/coverage
